<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Dean Foods dropped from list.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Dean Foods dropped from list.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities has dropped Dean Foods Co from its list of select stocks, but has kept the company on its single best-idea list, a Prudential source said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- The company's stock closed at 29-7/8 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
